<!-- Static sitemap of the public routes (see app/src/routes/paths.ts).
     /admin/* is gated by Cloudflare Access and is intentionally omitted.
     The two area hubs (/lesen, /schreiben) are navigational; the tools they
     point to (/quiz, /tafel, /schreiben/uebungsblatt, /federprobe) carry the
     content weight. Keep in sync with paths.ts; bump <lastmod> when a page's
     content changes. Revisit once the i18n /de/ and /en/ prefixes land
     (docs/reference/frontend-stack.md §Sitemap).

     <lastmod> is not bookkeeping alone: prerender.ts reads it as each crawler
     page's visible "Stand" line, so a stale date tells every bot the text is
     older than it is (four routes had drifted up to two weeks by the website
     audit 2026-09-02). `npm run prerender` therefore runs
     scripts/check-sitemap-lastmod.mjs, which holds every date against the git
     history of the rendered page itself, app/prerender/<page>.html. -->
